WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.567 --> 00:00:05.505
ANYONE GROCERY SHOPPING LATELY
CAN'T NOTICE HOW THE PRICE FOR A

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:12.345
