THERE WAS A LOT OF DEMAND FOR

00:03:35.348 --> 00:03:36.449
EGGS.
PEOPLE WERE BAKING.

00:03:36.449 --> 00:03:39.819
PEOPLE WERE COOKING, BUT WE'RE
THROUGH THE HOLIDAYS NOW.

00:03:39.819 --> 00:03:43.589
SO DEMAND MAY BE JUST A LITTLE
BIT LOWER, BUT, YOU KNOW, IT'S

00:03:43.589 --> 00:03:48.194
